;; Card 5165130a (efebfbf2): a body shut in its own dirt room (an own plan's shell) set in glowstone, which an escalation never
;; digs (not natural terrain), its goal a sealed 1x2 pocket in the glowstone. Each guess of the dig route that a look shows to be glowstone
;; raises the risk of the next route's guesses: the dig route cuts a few own wall cells (two columns, 4), not a column per guess,
;; and is not chosen again; no caller :worth, so a stair out is still begun and ends not-diggable, then the call ends.
;; The call ends, a failure with its reason, and every cell of the shell is dirt again (cuts are put back, no wall wrecked).
;; Glowstone x 10..26, y 0..9, z 10..26; the shell x 14..18, y 1..5, z 14..18, hollow (inside x 15..17, y 2..4); goal pocket [20 2..3 18].
